<title>FINLAND: Metra Jan-Aug profit slightly higher.</title>
<headline>Metra Jan-Aug profit slightly higher.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items	    395 vs 392</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    9.65 vs 9.25</p>
<p> Net sales				   6,615 vs 5,786</p>
<p> Operating profit			    535 vs 500</p>
<p> Depreciation				  298 vs 306</p>
<p> Net financial items		charge 114 vs 119 charge</p>
<p>Share in results of</p>
<p> associated companies		charge 26 vs 11 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		   gain 33 vs 60 charge</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes	 428 vs 332</p>
<p> Minorities				 gain 6 vs 6 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					    80 vs 135</p>
<p> Net profit				    354 vs 191</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     36.0 vs 36.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast profit after financial items, before extraordinaries was 515 million markka (mean 532 million) in a 469 million to 675 million markka range.  </p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish diversified engineering group is Metra Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0245</p>
</text>
